    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jameson Court is a beautifully designed and well-maintained modern cul-de-sac development of attractive family homes, ideally positioned just off Watermill Road and within a stone’s throw of the wonderful amenities of St. Anne’s Park and Bull Island Nature Reserve.\r\n\r\nNo. 3 is an impressive four-bedroom family home extending to approximately 152 sq m, offering bright, spacious and contemporary accommodation arranged over three floors. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property has been tastefully decorated by the current owners and offers a stylish and comfortable home perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\nOn entering, a welcoming hallway leads to a guest WC and a bright and comfortable living room. Double doors open through to a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area, creating an excellent space for both everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen/dining area enjoys direct access to the beautifully landscaped private rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe first floor features a generous landing area with a useful utility area, three well-proportioned bedrooms, including one with an ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe second floor is dedicated to a particularly impressive main bedroom suite. This spacious bedroom features a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish ensuite, providing an excellent sense of privacy and comfort.\r\n\r\nThe property therefore benefits from four bathroom/WC facilities in total: two ensuite bathrooms, one family bathroom and a guest WC.\r\n\r\nThe property is further complemented by a private landscaped rear garden, while to the front there are two designated parking spaces and convenient bin storage.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, with Raheny Village just minutes away, offering an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services. The area is also well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, while excellent transport links, including bus and DART services, provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nNo. 3 Jameson Court represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a stylish and beautifully presented modern four-bedroom home in a highly sought-after location. The combination of excellent accommodation, quality presentation and a superb setting makes this a home that is sure to appeal to families and discerning purchasers alike.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.3m x 1.8m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 6.25m x 5.75m \r\n\r\n\r\nWC - 1.55m x 1.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.8m x 2.65m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.25m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 1.8m x 1.65m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.65m x 2.65m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.9m x 2.65m \r\n\r\n\r\nUtility - 0.8m x 1.1m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.35m x 4.35m \r\n\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 1.2m x 2.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nwalk in wardrobe - 1.55m x 1.95m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
