      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tImpressive four-bedroom family home extending to approximately 152 sq m and arranged over three spacious floors\r\n\r\n•\tHighly sought-after cul-de-sac development in a superb Raheny location\r\n\r\n•\tBright and beautifully presented interiors throughout\r\n\r\n•\tExcellent open-plan kitchen/dining area ideal for modern family living and entertaining\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate, landscaped rear garden with direct access from the kitchen/dining area\r\n\r\n•\tGenerous main bedroom suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n\r\n•\tFour bathroom/WC facilities in total, comprising two ensuites, a family bathroom and a ground-floor guest WC\r\n\r\n•\tTwo designated parking spaces to the front with additional bin storage\r\n\r\n•\tExcellent transport links with nearby DART and bus services to Dublin City Centre\r\n\r\n•\tWithin a stone’s throw of St. Anne’s Park and Bull Island Nature Reserve, and close to Raheny Village with its wide range of schools, shops, cafés and restaurants"
